{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And the afflicted one.</b> Even the high priest, about whom it is said: ״את ראשו לא יפרע ובגדיו לא יפרום״ — here his garments shall be torn, etc." "<b>His garments shall be torn.</b> Let him mourn over his deeds, for because of the evil of his deeds the affliction came upon him." "<b>And he shall cover his upper lip.</b> To block the foul odor coming from his mouth, so as not to harm people."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:01.173440835Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}